<attribute name="problem" nodeId="2d77b7fa">The Oracle Services practice plays a vital role in driving the successful adoption, utilization and optimization of Oracle
technologies for EY clients. The EY Accelerate (EYA) for Oracle Services methodology provides a standardized hybrid agile
approach for implementing both on-premise and cloud Oracle services at client organizations.</attribute>
<attribute name="background" nodeId="8e0d61c8">The EYA for Oracle Services methodology provides the benefits of agile iterative build cycles and feedback loops along with
the discipline of the traditional waterfall approach. It enables our clients to accelerate their digital transformation
initiatives without compromising on consistency, accuracy or efficiency. It allows EY engagement teams to rapidly mobilize
our highly skilled professionals, reduce operational costs and mitigate risks associated with the client’s Oracle
investments.</attribute>
<attribute name="goals" nodeId="54ddd315">&lt;p&gt;
    The delivery process showcased in this method web incorporates industry leading practices, the collective experiences
    of our practitioners and insights from our past Oracle implementations. It is supported by relevant pursuit materials,
    tools and enablers, trainings and a customizable starter project plan. The method can be used right from the pursuit
    stage and throughout the engagement lifecycle.
&lt;/p&gt;
